  "changed": "F413 unifies namespace/upload-create CLI JSON decoding with the existing API typed-object boundary. The extracted actual old CLI decoder admits duplicate/aliased fields,invalid UTF8 and an oversized stream prefix;all observed reds are retained. The shared API decoder also admits root null and Unicode long-s aliases for ASCII revision fields;MCP first-guard literal/escaped aliases are separately observed red. Read one extra byte without raising the existing16KiB CLI limit,require object controls and reject Unicode-to-ASCII field aliases before typed/SDK decoding. Preserve existing32KiB/16depth/4096token workflow and32KiB/16depth/8192token MCP bounds,valid Unicode data,camel-case MCP metadata and explicit zero options. Focused guards,fuzz seeds,tagged compilation,vet,format and architecture pass. The original JSON transport stand-in first cannot bind loopback under sandbox;the exact test passes with permitted loopback and one CPU/192MiB Go limit. It loads no model and establishes no inference qualification. Prepared native API/CLI/MCP no-effect and stock-client compatibility remain owed;all authority/custody/execution checks stay enforced.",
